# Everything under the artifacts root (lab-context.sh: PERFLAB_ARTIFACTS_ROOT,
# default "artifacts") is generated by a run -- evidence packages under
# artifacts/runs/<run-id>/ plus any ad-hoc exports. Nothing here is committed;
# a run promoted for comparison is stored as a baseline under
# labs/<lab>/baselines/ and the cross-commit trend in perf-history/.
artifacts/
perf-history/